carry their own licences; their credit lines are written to credits.json and must be added to the video description when
a licence requires attribution. Music and sound effects generated by core/tools/make_pulse_track.py and make_synth_library.py
are synthesised on the user's machine (no samples) and belong to whoever generates them.

REFERENCE VIDEOS
Vidbucks analyses public metadata/captions and measures files the user supplies; it does not download or redistribute other
people's videos. The user is responsible for the rights to any file they provide.
